    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33453" root="فرد" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفْرِدٌ</span></b>  A female, (S, L,) a pregnant female, (A,)
or a ewe or she-goat, (M,) or a woman, (K,)
<i>bringing forth one only:</i> (S, M, A, L, K:) like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوحِدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفِذٌّ</span>: (S, L:) opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتْئِمٌ</span>. (A.)
[See its verb, 4.]

